    "Every factor replacement increases mean UP in every fixed panel/task context. This is an empirical functional shift, not proof of historical training causation or true conditional bias.",
    "P is one contribution rather than the sole deterioration source. TRAIN F Brier Shapley is C+.002800911/P+.002148507/H+.009150453.",
    "The small later S panel improves from INITIAL to FINAL, while full-population earlier evaluation worsened. This reused panel must not replace the full-population generalization conclusion.",
    "For101-minus111, empirical mean-error squared and centered Brier move in the same direction in all4 cells. The effect is not only a constant mean shift; centered Brier is not pure ranking quality."
